# Short wireless-debugging bootstrap, XPLORE 2, 2026-11-27.
# Curated transcript (timestamps and lines copied from logcat and shell output).
# The temporary STA was the laptop AP "PhoneLink" at 5745 MHz; USB adb was the
# lifeline. Passphrases and pairing PINs are deliberately omitted.

# 1. Keeper enables the toggle and pins 5555 over its own TLS key.
11-27 19:18:58.442  adbd       adbwifi started on port 37193
11-27 19:19:00.685  WifiDebug  info pin.tls_ok asked adbd over TLS to listen on 5555
11-27 19:19:00.689  WifiDebug  info pin.waiting asked the app's TLS client to pin port 5555
11-27 19:19:00.689  WifiDebug  pin check: closed (asked the app's TLS client)
11-27 19:19:00.728  adbd       adbwifi started on port 34019
11-27 19:19:10.341  WifiDebug  info pin.state listening on 5555
11-27 19:19:10.341  WifiDebug  pin check: listening on 5555

# The laptop's existing key works over TLS, no new pairing.
$ adb connect 192.168.77.232:34019
connected to 192.168.77.232:34019
$ getprop service.adb.tcp.port
5555
$ settings get global adb_wifi_enabled
1

# 2. Turn the temporary AP off. The toggle reverts and the TLS listener dies,
#    but the legacy listener stays.
11-27 19:20:02.219  adbd  ADB wifi device disconnected
$ cmd wifi status        -> Wifi is not connected
$ settings get global adb_wifi_enabled -> 0
$ getprop service.adb.tcp.port         -> 5555
$ ss -ltn | grep 5555                  -> LISTEN *:5555

# 3. Hotspot on, no STA, no external AP. The address is read from ap0.
$ adb connect 10.231.103.217:5555
connected to 10.231.103.217:5555
$ adb -s 10.231.103.217:5555 shell id
uid=2000(shell) gid=2000(shell) ...
$ adb -s 10.231.103.217:5555 shell 'getprop service.adb.tcp.port; settings get global adb_wifi_enabled'
5555
0
$ ip -4 -o addr show ap0
42: ap0    inet 10.231.103.217/24 brd 10.231.103.255 scope global ap0

# 4. A hotspot off/on in the same boot keeps the subnet and 5555.
$ before=10.231.103.217/24  after=10.231.103.217/24  changed=no
$ adb connect 10.231.103.217:5555
connected to 10.231.103.217:5555
$ adb -s 10.231.103.217:5555 shell echo PERSISTED_ACROSS_HOTSPOT_TOGGLE
PERSISTED_ACROSS_HOTSPOT_TOGGLE
